---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
const title = 'Amati Coffee Portfolio | Adsbangda';
const description = 'Amati Coffee portfolio: menu promotion content, KOL management, and top-performing content that reached 554K views.';
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} path="en/portofolio-amati-coffee.html" lang="id" lang="en" hreflangId="portofolio-amati-coffee.html" portfolioCss={true} ogImageAlt="Amati Coffee portfolio by Adsbangda" ogImage="assets/img/img-js-ee7bcd835b90.webp" ogImageWidth={700} ogImageHeight={481}>
{ /* head-style slot: CSS khusus halaman ini (kalau ada) */ }
<Fragment slot="head-style">
<style>
.cd-summary{font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#3b3d3a;margin:28px 0 50px;text-align:justify;}

.project-block .mp-thumb img{width:100%;display:block;}

.project-block .mp-thumb img, .modal-project .mp-thumb img{cursor:zoom-in;transition:transform .25s ease, filter .25s ease;}

.project-block .mp-thumb img:hover, .modal-project .mp-thumb img:hover{transform:scale(1.02);filter:brightness(.95);}

/* ---- case study: tools & software ---- */
.tools-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,max-content);justify-content:flex-start;align-items:start;gap:40px 55px;margin-top:0;}

@media (max-width:640px){.tools-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

.tools-icon-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,56px);justify-content:flex-start;gap:20px 30px;}

.tool-item{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;width:100%;text-align:left;min-width:0;}
</style>
</Fragment>



<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <a href="portofolio.html" class="back-link reveal" data-i18n="back_link" style="margin-bottom:22px;display:inline-flex;">&larr; Back to Portfolio</a>
    <h1>Amati Coffee</h1>
    <p data-i18n="hero_h2" style="font-size:20px;font-weight:700;margin-top:18px;line-height:1.5;">Building Amati Coffee's Digital Presence Remotely with a Consistent Content Strategy</p>
    <p class="cd-summary" data-i18n="hero_lede1" style="margin:20px 0 0;">Adsbangda helped Amati Coffee grow its digital presence through a Social Media Management strategy run remotely from Batam. The entire process — from content planning and production coordination to performance evaluation — was carried out collaboratively with the on-site team.</p>
    <p class="cd-summary" data-i18n="hero_lede2" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Throughout the collaboration, we didn't just manage social media — we also supported Amati Coffee's business growth through relevant content strategy, KOL collaborations, and creative ideas that helped sustainably increase brand awareness and engagement.</p>

    <div class="hero-meta reveal">
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(244,228,9,.25);">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3.5l8 4.3-8 4.3-8-4.3 8-4.3z" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 12.2l8 4.3 8-4.3" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 16.5l8 4.3 8-4.3" stroke="#8a7c00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k3">Services</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v3">Social Media Management, KOL Management, Content Strategy</b>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(255,74,61,.12);">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="13.5" y="3.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="3.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/><rect x="13.5" y="13.5" width="7" height="7" rx="1.6" stroke="#FF4A3D" stroke-width="1.8"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k4">Platform</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v4">Instagram, TikTok</b>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta-item">
        <div class="overview-icon" style="background:rgba(27,75,67,.12);">
          <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M20.5 13.2L13 20.7a1.6 1.6 0 0 1-2.3 0l-7.2-7.2V4.3h9.2l7.2 7.2a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 .6 1.7z" stroke="#1B4B43" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><circle cx="8.3" cy="8.3" r="1.4" fill="#1B4B43"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-text">
          <span data-i18n="ov_k5">Category</span>
          <b data-i18n="ov_v5">Social Media Management &amp; Content Marketing</b>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" style="padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:80px;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
        <h2 data-i18n="about_label">About The Project</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p1" style="margin:0 0 20px;">Amati Coffee is a coffee shop located in Batam, offering a variety of coffee, drinks, and food with a concept close to young people's lifestyle.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p2" style="margin:0 0 20px;">Although this project was carried out remotely, we built intensive communication with the Amati Coffee team through briefings, idea discussions, content evaluations, and periodic campaign planning. This collaborative approach ensured every piece of content stayed true to the brand's character and the local Batam market.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="about_p3" style="margin:0;">Beyond managing social media, we also contributed to business strategy development through creative campaign ideas, KOL collaborations, and content concepts that increased organic reach and strengthened brand identity.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="summary">From daily social media content and Instagram Story, to KOL collaborations and content that reached 554K views — here is the content strategy we ran for Amati Coffee.</p>
            <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p1_h2">Social Media Management</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img role="button" tabindex="0" src="assets/img/img-8a20fd7ea8f6.webp" alt="Sosial Media Content — Amati Coffee" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p1_desc">We managed the entire content production process for Amati Coffee's social media — from content planning, copywriting, and visual design to video editing and regular publishing.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p1_desc2">The content strategy focused on menu promotion, brand storytelling, light education, social media trends, and entertainment content relevant to the target audience, maintaining engagement while strengthening customer relationships.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl1">5–7 New Pieces of Content Every Week</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl2">Promotional, Educational &amp; Entertainment Content</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p1_hl3">Trend-Based Content Strategy</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="story_h2">Story Content</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img role="button" tabindex="0" src="assets/img/img-c65fd3891467.webp" alt="Story Content — Amati Coffee" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="story_desc">Besides the main content, we also managed daily Instagram Story as a faster communication channel with customers.</p>
        <p data-i18n="story_desc2">Story content was used to share operational information, promos, events, and daily outlet activities, keeping the account active and interactive every day.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="story_hl1">Daily Updates</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="story_hl2">Promo &amp; Event Information</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="story_hl3">Closer Interaction With The Audience</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p2_h2">KOL Management</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img role="button" tabindex="0" src="assets/img/img-333132ad0a84.webp" alt="KOL Management — Amati Coffee" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p2_desc">We managed collaborations with various food and lifestyle creators in Batam — from selecting KOLs matching the target audience, preparing briefs, and coordinating production, to evaluating content performance.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p2_desc2">This approach helped Amati Coffee gain wider exposure while building trust with potential customers through more authentic promotion.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl1">Creator Selection &amp; Outreach</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl2">Campaign Brief &amp; Coordination</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p2_hl3">Performance Monitoring</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p3_h2">Top Performing Content</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img role="button" tabindex="0" src="assets/img/img-5fad203f43e2.webp" alt="Top-Performing Content — Amati Coffee" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p3_desc">One strategy we applied was leveraging short video formats following social media trends with a light, shareable storytelling approach.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p3_desc2">Through this approach, several pieces of content achieved excellent organic performance, including one video that reached over 554,000 views without paid promotion.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p3_hl1">554K+ Views</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p3_hl2">POV &amp; Storytelling Format</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p3_hl3">Viral Organically</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="project-block reveal">
        <h3 data-i18n="p4_h2">Collaboration</h3>
        <div class="mp-thumb"><img role="button" tabindex="0" src="assets/img/img-8536e0a3f3d0.webp" alt="Collaboration — Amati Coffee" loading="lazy"></div>
        <p data-i18n="p4_desc">Besides internal content production, we also helped design various collaborations with communities and local brands in Batam.</p>
        <p data-i18n="p4_desc2">These collaborations aimed to expand audience reach, increase engagement, and strengthen Amati Coffee's position as part of the local community.</p>
        <div class="highlight-grid">
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p4_hl1">Cross-Brand Collaboration</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p4_hl2">Community Engagement</span></div>
          <div class="highlight-chip"><div class="hc-icon"><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 12l4-4 3 3 5-6"/><path d="M11 5h3v3"/></svg></div><span data-i18n="p4_hl3">Brand Awareness Growth</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" style="padding:90px 0;">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:28px;">
      <h2 data-i18n="wf_label">Project Workflow</h2>
      <p data-i18n="wf_desc">We apply a structured workflow even though the project is run remotely, so communication with the Amati Coffee team stays effective and every piece of content is produced on schedule.</p>
