  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cd-wrap">
      <div class="section-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
        <h2 data-i18n="impact_label">Project Impact</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="impact_p1" style="margin:0 0 20px;">Through a consistently run Social Media Management strategy, Amati Coffee successfully built a stronger digital presence with content that is relevant, creative, and close to its target audience.</p>
      <p class="cd-summary reveal" data-i18n="impact_p2" style="margin:0;">This remote collaboration proved that the right communication and strategy can produce quality content, expand brand reach, increase engagement, and support the growth of Amati Coffee's business in Batam.</p>
